    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d877">

                <pb facs="0830" n="740" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav02/pg740"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/918</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Norway</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Schmedeman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Christiania</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-01-08T14:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 8,
                                1918, 2 p.m.</hi></date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 5.52 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>451. A Finnish commission is to arrive here to-day for the purpose of requesting
                    recognition by the Norwegian Government of Finnish independence. Minister for
                    Foreign Affairs informed me <pb facs="0831" n="741" xml:id="pg741"/> this
                    morning that independence of Finland would undoubtedly be recognized by
                    Norway.</p>
                <p>The press reports that one or more members of the commission will proceed from
                    here to the United States.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Schmedeman</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
